      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Place asparagus and mushrooms in a bowl. Drizzle with olive oil, then season with rosemary, salt, and pepper; toss well. Lay vegetables on the prepared tray in an even layer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast in the preheated oven until asparagus is tender, about 15 minutes.",
